  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Capacity strengthening of the Sudan and South Sudan Catholic Bishops Conference.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of its ongoing restructuring process, the Sudan and South Sudan Catholic Bishops Conference (SSSCBC) is planning to strengthen the institutional and staff capacity of the SSCBC. This initiative aims to align the conference&apos;s roles and responsibilities with its mandate, improve operational efficiency, resource mobilization and enhance staff performance.
The conference plans to strengthen its institutional capacity to appropriately respond to and act on the identified contextual challenges in line with conference mandate and aligning with the Global Church agenda. The institutional capacity strengthening will include: -
- Development of long-term strategic institutional structure, policies and plan
- Support to the operational costs for the secretariat to deliver its core functions effectively in line with the conference mission.</narrative>
  </description>
